WEBVTT

00:00:28.792 --> 00:00:30.667
Good morning, Tomo.

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:33.792
Good morning, Sohara.

00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:38.125
Okay, we're off. Hold down
the fort while I'm gone, okay?

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:40.167
Yes, Master.

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:42.208
Where are you going?

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:46.625
To school. Summer vacation is
over, and classes start again today.

00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:50.792
Oh, and let me say right now,

00:00:50.792 --> 00:00:53.125
don't either of you dare come to school!

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:54.792
Yes.

00:00:54.792 --> 00:00:57.208
Tomo, we're going to be late!

00:00:57.208 --> 00:00:59.250
Yeah! Okay, we're leaving.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.583
Yes, Master.

00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:04.125
Hey, did you do the handout for
Japanese that came out yesterday?

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:05.167
Of course.

00:01:05.167 --> 00:01:06.250
--Let me see, let me see.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.958
--No way. Wait,
--Let me see, let me see.

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:10.375
if you buy me some sweets
on the way home, I'll think about it.

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:14.458
What, you want to go to school?

00:01:14.458 --> 00:01:17.875
But I promised Master not to.

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:22.042
Ah, geez, give me that!

00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:29.125
<i>I can hear my heart bell</i>

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.708
<i>dou shita tte iu no</i>

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:35.417
<i>mune no beru ga naru</i>

00:01:36.792 --> 00:01:41.000
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:46.958
<i>hajimari wa ano toki datta (ringin' ringin')</i>

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:52.583
<i>kimi ga me no mae ni totsuzen (ringin' ringin')</i>

00:01:52.583 --> 00:01:57.792
<i>arawareta no wa umareru mae kara</i>

00:01:57.792 --> 00:02:00.708
<i>kimerarete'ta n da ne</i>

00:02:00.708 --> 00:02:03.583
<i>kitto sou da yo</i>

00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:09.208
<i>negai ya yabou ya kuusou ga</i>

00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:14.917
<i>shiranai reberu e doa o tataite</i>

00:02:14.917 --> 00:02:21.125
<i>habataku kagi to mirai o kureru</i>
<i>(with your wings)</i>

00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:24.042
<i>I can hear my heart bell</i>

00:02:24.042 --> 00:02:27.042
<i>tomerarenai yo</i>

00:02:27.042 --> 00:02:32.625
<i>tenshi ga narashiteru</i>
<i>"daisuki" no aizu da yo ne</i>

00:02:32.625 --> 00:02:35.500
<i>can you hear my heart bell?</i>

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.958
<i>dou shita tte iu no</i>

00:02:37.958 --> 00:02:43.375
<i>kiita koto ga nai mune no beru ga naru</i>

00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:52.500
<i>sore de mo mada kimi</i>
<i>wa nani mo shiranai keredo</i>

00:02:57.667 --> 00:03:01.625
Why does man continue
to yearn for the sky so much?

00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:04.500
There is a certain anecdote
in Greek mythology.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.208
In it, a man attached wings
made of hardened wax to himself,

00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:08.708
and flew through the air.

00:03:08.708 --> 00:03:13.333
The people on the ground
revered him as a god. However,

00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:16.583
because he got too close
to the sun, the wax melted,

00:03:16.583 --> 00:03:19.625
and the man plunged into the sea.

00:03:19.625 --> 00:03:24.125
It is said that the man,
as well as the sea, bear the name...

00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:25.625
Ikaros.

00:03:25.625 --> 00:03:27.667
Yes?

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:29.417
You don't need to reply.

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:31.250
I am sorry.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.083
All people should be able to fly.

00:03:39.083 --> 00:03:39.583
"II"

00:03:39.583 --> 00:03:42.417
Everyone has unseen wings.

00:03:46.042 --> 00:03:48.958
<i>What is Ikaros doing here at school?</i>

00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:53.125
"The Brainy, Heart-pounding
Transfer Students"

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.500
First off, let me introduce
our new transfer students.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.375
"Nymph"              "Ikaros"

00:03:58.375 --> 00:04:01.208
This is Ikaros and Nymph.

00:04:01.208 --> 00:04:03.500
Everyone, be nice to them.

00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:09.542
<i>What are they doing here?</i>

00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:18.958
I am hot.

00:04:25.167 --> 00:04:27.167
Master, um...

00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:29.000
What's this? She knows Sakurai?

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.208
They're both extremely cute.

00:04:31.208 --> 00:04:32.750
Those girls have wings.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.833
So that's the kind of girl Sakurai goes for.

00:04:34.833 --> 00:04:35.708
--T-Tomo...

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.042
--Why the watermelon?
--T-Tomo...

00:04:37.042 --> 00:04:39.417
<i>If I make a fuss now, everyone will know</i>

00:04:39.417 --> 00:04:41.542
<i>that I've been involved</i>
<i>with these mythical beings.</i>

00:04:41.542 --> 00:04:45.417
<i>Remain calm, Tomoki.</i>
<i>Nothing beats peace and quiet.</i>

00:04:45.417 --> 00:04:48.000
<i>Nothing beats peace and quiet!</i>

00:04:54.292 --> 00:04:56.333
What the hell is this?

00:04:56.333 --> 00:04:58.292
I am sorry, Master.

00:04:58.292 --> 00:05:00.667
We should be able to come
to school, shouldn't we?

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:04.083
It doesn't end with you just
coming here! You'll cause problems!

00:05:04.083 --> 00:05:08.542
Now, now, Sakurai,
you don't have to get so mad at them.

00:05:08.542 --> 00:05:09.958
What's the fuss?

00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:12.750
They'll experience some
stimulating, everyday life.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.250
You keep going on like
it's not your problem, too!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.833
That's because it's not.

00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:19.792
What did you say?!

00:05:19.792 --> 00:05:21.458
Wow, amazing!

00:05:21.458 --> 00:05:24.458
You've got sleeves in the
backs of your uniforms for your wings!

00:05:24.458 --> 00:05:28.333
Will you guys listen to me for a second?!

00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:31.333
For that matter, how did you transfer in?

00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:35.042
We used one of Alpha's cards to
tweak the teacher's memory a bit.

00:05:35.042 --> 00:05:37.167
Stop doing such dreadful stuff!

00:05:37.167 --> 00:05:40.458
Calm down a little bit, Tomoki.

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:44.000
In all seriousness, isn't it a good idea

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.625
to have them acclimate
to a normal person's life?

00:05:47.625 --> 00:05:52.167
You're always telling Ikaros
to act more human, right?

00:05:52.167 --> 00:05:58.167
He's right. We need to show Nymph
the way the world works, as well.

00:06:00.208 --> 00:06:03.667
She looks and acts like a doll
who isn't even able to smile.

00:06:03.667 --> 00:06:06.667
You want to do something about that, right?

00:06:11.917 --> 00:06:13.792
All right.

00:06:13.792 --> 00:06:17.583
But just make sure
that you behave yourselves!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.792
Yeah, we know, bug.

00:06:20.792 --> 00:06:24.750
That's terrific, Ikaros and Nymph.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:28.875
Just leave it to me.
I'll teach you all about school life.

00:06:29.208 --> 00:06:29.542
"First Period--Social Studies"

00:06:29.542 --> 00:06:34.708
So you see, because Australia
is such a vast land,

00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:36.333
it has a varied climate.

00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:38.167
All right!

00:06:41.083 --> 00:06:45.000
How are you doing, Ikaros?
Are you taking close notes?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.583
If you like, you can use my notes to...

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:55.542
<i>Hmm, right, even Ikaros would be able</i>

00:06:55.542 --> 00:06:59.792
<i>to neatly copy off of the blackboard.</i>

00:07:00.708 --> 00:07:01.917
<i>I know!</i>

00:07:01.917 --> 00:07:05.417
<i>Nymph has had even less time living among us.</i>

00:07:05.417 --> 00:07:08.417
<i>I'll have to teach her all sorts of things.</i>

00:07:08.417 --> 00:07:13.250
Nymph, are you taking notes?
If you like, you can use my notes to...

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:14.875
No need.

00:07:16.083 --> 00:07:20.667
Oh, okay. Nymph, what are you looking at?

00:07:20.667 --> 00:07:22.875
The birds.

00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:25.208
So you like birds.

00:07:25.208 --> 00:07:27.792
Then I'll tell you what their names are.

00:07:27.792 --> 00:07:32.917
That one is called a sparrow.
And that one is, um...

00:07:32.917 --> 00:07:35.208
A black-backed wagtail, right?

00:07:35.208 --> 00:07:36.333
White-eye...

00:07:36.333 --> 00:07:37.750
gray wagtail...

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.875
and I think that one's a great tit.

00:07:39.875 --> 00:07:41.542
There are turtledoves,
white-cheeked starlings,

00:07:41.542 --> 00:07:44.958
and brown-eared bulbuls there, as well.

00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:48.333
"Second Period--Home Economics"
Today we're doing cooking practice.

00:07:48.333 --> 00:07:51.875
Divide up into your groups,
and make up your own menu.

00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:53.667
Right!

00:07:53.667 --> 00:07:57.000
<i>All right, Home Ec is my best class.</i>

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.667
<i>Now is my chance to offer</i>
<i>Ikaros and Nymph my advice.</i>

00:08:01.875 --> 00:08:06.958
Hold on, Ikaros, you hold the knife like this.

00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:10.417
Nymph, if you add just a touch of soy sauce,

00:08:10.417 --> 00:08:12.458
it will turn out incredibly delicious.

00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:15.833
Amazing. Thank you, Sohara.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.417
<i>Mm-hmm, I've got to give it my all!</i>

00:08:19.417 --> 00:08:21.125
Ms. Tadai!

00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:25.333
Ikaros and Nymph are not in our group.

00:08:34.917 --> 00:08:37.000
Sorry we are late.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.375
Why should I have to do this, too?

00:08:40.375 --> 00:08:44.375
I am sorry, I did not
have enough hands alone.

00:08:44.375 --> 00:08:47.375
W-Well then, let's start cooking.

00:08:49.917 --> 00:08:51.833
That's amazing, Ikaros!

00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:54.917
That looks so delicious! She's a master!

00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:04.250
Yum! I love sweets!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:07.083
Hey, it's not time to eat yet.

00:09:07.083 --> 00:09:09.500
Hush, would you?

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.958
Are you cooking something, too?

00:09:11.958 --> 00:09:13.583
That.

00:09:17.333 --> 00:09:20.042
Hey, if you do that...!

00:09:22.917 --> 00:09:26.125
Yep, sure enough.

00:09:26.125 --> 00:09:28.000
"Third Period--Mathematics"
Nymph, our new transfer student,

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.708
were you so far
ahead in your previous school

00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:33.708
that you don't need to listen to the lesson?

00:09:33.708 --> 00:09:36.292
You're ignoring me?
As punishment for looking outside,

00:09:36.292 --> 00:09:38.417
you have to answer this question!

00:09:38.417 --> 00:09:40.125
Assume a circle of diameter 1

00:09:40.125 --> 00:09:42.708
is inscribed inside a regular dodecagon.

00:09:42.708 --> 00:09:44.542
--Assign "x" as the length of
one of the sides of the dodecagon.

00:09:44.542 --> 00:09:45.667
--W-What language is that? I can't even understand the question.
--Assign "x" as the length of one of the sides of the dodecagon.

00:09:45.667 --> 00:09:47.583
--W-What language is that? I can't even understand the question.
--According to the law of cosines,

00:09:47.583 --> 00:09:49.500
--W-What language is that? I can't even understand the question.
--x² = 1²+1²-2×1×1×cos 30° = 2-√3...

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:53.125
--Ikaros, do you understand it?
--x² = 1²+1²-2×1×1×cos 30° = 2-√3...

00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:54.500
I know, right?

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:58.042
You there! If you can afford
to whisper to your neighbor,

00:09:58.042 --> 00:10:00.083
then answer this question!

00:10:00.083 --> 00:10:02.375
Huh? What do I do?

00:10:06.042 --> 00:10:07.500
H-Hey, Ikaros...

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:13.042
Let F(x) = x²-nx+m

00:10:13.042 --> 00:10:19.792
Per the equation of the axis of
symmetry, x = 2/n ≤ 2N; thus x =

00:10:20.167 --> 00:10:21.417
"Fourth Period--English"
"Apple."

00:10:21.417 --> 00:10:23.250
"Appole."

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.500
"Apple."

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:26.292
"Appah..."

00:10:26.292 --> 00:10:27.417
"Apple."

00:10:27.417 --> 00:10:29.292
"Appoli..."

00:10:32.833 --> 00:10:35.833
"Appoh!" "Appoh!" "Appoh!"
"Appoh!" "Appoh!" "Appoh!"

00:10:37.292 --> 00:10:40.292
Alpha, by any chance, are you...

00:10:47.333 --> 00:10:50.750
I just found out something interesting.

00:10:52.167 --> 00:10:56.208
This was worth tagging
along with you to school.

00:11:03.708 --> 00:11:05.917
How did your morning classes go?

00:11:05.917 --> 00:11:07.583
It was disastrous.

00:11:07.583 --> 00:11:09.958
Although, I was surprised
that Nymph and Ikaros

00:11:09.958 --> 00:11:12.417
were both such honor students.

00:11:12.417 --> 00:11:15.167
Have the two of them become
accustomed to the school?

00:11:15.167 --> 00:11:19.500
It looks like they've been
accepted by the boys, at least.

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:20.917
Look.

00:11:22.583 --> 00:11:24.083
When did that happen?

00:11:24.083 --> 00:11:27.083
The whole school is abuzz with stories

00:11:27.083 --> 00:11:29.583
about some cute
transfer students arriving.

00:11:29.583 --> 00:11:31.208
Seriously?

00:11:34.333 --> 00:11:37.500
Hey, you pack of bugs! Keep it down!

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.417
I'm watching the soaps!

00:11:39.417 --> 00:11:41.917
That should keep those icky bugs at bay.

00:11:41.917 --> 00:11:43.417
Nice!

00:11:43.417 --> 00:11:45.500
We want to be yelled at some more!

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.125
Come to think of it, where's Mitsuki?

00:11:47.125 --> 00:11:49.292
She's over there.

00:11:50.125 --> 00:11:51.375
What's the matter?

00:11:51.375 --> 00:11:52.958
Please leave me alone.

00:11:52.958 --> 00:11:54.542
Don't tell me you're depressed

00:11:54.542 --> 00:11:58.958
because you're comparing
yourself to those honor students.

00:11:58.958 --> 00:12:01.125
Oh, I'm right?

00:12:01.125 --> 00:12:03.708
Mikako, be nice to her.

00:12:03.708 --> 00:12:06.083
Well, time for afternoon classes.

00:12:06.083 --> 00:12:10.958
Huh? There are still
more classes? I'm tired of this.

00:12:12.167 --> 00:12:13.625
Say, Alpha...

00:12:13.625 --> 00:12:18.917
Stop that, you filthy brute!
Have you no shame?!

00:12:18.917 --> 00:12:23.542
Okay, today's topic is elemental symbols,
chemical formulas, and...

00:12:23.542 --> 00:12:26.167
Ga-gappee! Gappee! Ga-gappee!!

00:12:26.167 --> 00:12:29.292
Oh, life is so fabulous!

00:12:29.292 --> 00:12:32.708
Ker-blaam!!

00:12:35.625 --> 00:12:38.250
Today, I would like to have

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:41.250
a substitute teacher instruct the class.

00:12:45.958 --> 00:12:48.042
This is Miss Ikaros.

00:12:48.042 --> 00:12:48.958
--My pleasure.

00:12:48.958 --> 00:12:50.833
<i>--Don't "my pleasure" us!</i>
--My pleasure.

00:12:50.833 --> 00:12:52.917
Wow, she looks good in a lab coat.

00:12:52.917 --> 00:12:54.583
Did you put her up to this?!

00:12:54.583 --> 00:12:58.750
I'm sure Ikaros will make a fine teacher.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.083
After all, she's so outstanding.

00:13:01.083 --> 00:13:02.833
That's not the issue here!

00:13:02.833 --> 00:13:05.792
So, Teacher, what is our lesson on today?

00:13:05.792 --> 00:13:08.125
And what are you even doing here?!

00:13:08.125 --> 00:13:11.542
Sakurai, how about we
have our physical exams?

00:13:11.542 --> 00:13:17.125
Stop always thinking of
ways to use others as your toys!

00:13:17.125 --> 00:13:18.292
"How to fly"

00:13:18.292 --> 00:13:20.333
Today's lesson...

00:13:23.333 --> 00:13:26.792
Well then, let us start right
off by having someone fly.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.292
Hey, who do you mean by "someone"?!

00:13:35.333 --> 00:13:38.208
Get your hands off of me!

00:13:38.208 --> 00:13:40.458
It will be all right.

00:13:40.458 --> 00:13:45.917
People have great wings on
their backs; they just cannot see them.

00:13:45.917 --> 00:13:48.542
Among them,

00:13:48.542 --> 00:13:52.917
you, Master, have especially large wings.

00:13:54.167 --> 00:13:57.917
I can tell. For some reason,

00:13:57.917 --> 00:13:59.750
I can tell.

00:14:06.208 --> 00:14:11.208
Master, the sky is calling out to you.

00:14:21.458 --> 00:14:23.208
Sakurai!

00:14:23.208 --> 00:14:26.708
Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:14:26.708 --> 00:14:33.792
Sakurai! Sakurai!
Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:14:33.792 --> 00:14:37.125
Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:14:37.125 --> 00:14:42.042
Sakurai! Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:14:42.042 --> 00:14:46.542
--Sakurai! Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:14:46.542 --> 00:14:48.625
--I thought something like this might happen.
--Sakurai! Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:14:48.625 --> 00:14:50.542
--Use them, Tomoki.
--Sakurai! Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:14:50.542 --> 00:14:52.375
Sugata...

00:14:55.333 --> 00:14:57.167
That looks so awesome!

00:14:57.167 --> 00:14:58.917
You're sure to fly, Sakurai!

00:14:58.917 --> 00:15:00.708
Go get 'em, Tomoki!

00:15:00.708 --> 00:15:02.375
For all of us!

00:15:02.375 --> 00:15:05.667
Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:15:05.667 --> 00:15:14.083
--Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:15:14.083 --> 00:15:18.208
<i>--Guys, I want you to remember something...</i>
--Sakurai! Sakurai!

00:15:21.875 --> 00:15:27.042
<i>If you believe, anyone is able to soar...</i>

00:15:30.042 --> 00:15:33.042
<i>...through wide-open skies.</i>

00:15:48.125 --> 00:15:51.000
I am sorry, Master.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.833
You're lucky, aren't you?
Only getting hurt as badly as you did.

00:15:53.833 --> 00:15:56.125
I don't even have the heart to get mad.

00:15:56.125 --> 00:15:59.958
I will never go to school again.

00:16:05.125 --> 00:16:07.375
Yeah, well, about that...

00:16:07.375 --> 00:16:10.333
You can still go, you know.

00:16:11.333 --> 00:16:14.792
It's okay. Both of you,
go back to school, as of tomorrow.

00:16:14.792 --> 00:16:17.250
Got it? Okay, then!

00:16:20.083 --> 00:16:22.792
Yes, Master.

00:16:31.667 --> 00:16:33.833
--Good morning!
--Good morning!

00:16:33.833 --> 00:16:36.417
Hey, Ikaros, did you do the math homework?

00:16:36.417 --> 00:16:37.375
Uh, yes.

00:16:37.375 --> 00:16:39.750
Nymph, you like the soaps, right?

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:40.167
--I like them, too.

00:16:40.167 --> 00:16:42.000
--Isn't that nice, Tomo?
--I like them, too.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.792
It looks like they'll both
have no trouble finding friends.

00:16:45.792 --> 00:16:47.208
Yeah.

00:17:05.708 --> 00:17:08.042
Haven't you ever seen an aviary before?

00:17:08.042 --> 00:17:11.042
Nymph loves birds. Don't you?

00:17:24.083 --> 00:17:26.917
How could you do that?!

00:17:28.833 --> 00:17:31.708
Who really cares?

00:17:37.833 --> 00:17:39.625
Wow, for real?

00:17:39.625 --> 00:17:42.625
Th-That's an awful lot of them.

00:17:42.625 --> 00:17:45.917
What are these, Master?

00:17:45.917 --> 00:17:48.958
Love letters! They're love letters!

00:17:48.958 --> 00:17:50.417
Love letters?

00:17:50.417 --> 00:17:52.667
What is all this?

00:17:53.958 --> 00:17:55.875
Stop that!

00:17:55.875 --> 00:18:00.250
Think a minute about the feelings
of the people who wrote those!

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:02.125
But I'm not interested.

00:18:02.125 --> 00:18:04.417
Look, just read some of them.

00:18:04.417 --> 00:18:05.750
At least take them home.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.417
Geez, what a nuisance.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:08.917
"New World Discovery Club"

00:18:08.917 --> 00:18:10.417
Love letters?

00:18:10.417 --> 00:18:13.042
That's right. A pile this big!

00:18:13.042 --> 00:18:15.708
But then, even if Ikaros
gets some love letters,

00:18:15.708 --> 00:18:18.292
can she comprehend
what romantic feelings are?

00:18:18.292 --> 00:18:20.500
We didn't know, so we
told her to go stay in the library,

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.500
and read them all carefully, one at a time.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:26.542
Oh, isn't that nice? If it were me,

00:18:26.542 --> 00:18:30.042
I would read them aloud
in front of the whole school.

00:18:30.042 --> 00:18:34.458
Y-You know, there are
all kinds out there in the world.

00:18:34.458 --> 00:18:36.833
I mean, she's got wings.

00:18:36.833 --> 00:18:40.250
Then again, Ikaros is pretty,
and good at cooking,

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.958
and even Nymph is cute and adorable.

00:18:42.958 --> 00:18:44.792
Yeah, that may be so.

00:18:44.792 --> 00:18:47.667
What do you think, Tomo?

00:18:48.917 --> 00:18:51.333
After living with Ikaros all this time,

00:18:51.333 --> 00:18:56.250
have you ever thought
that she was cute, or anything?

00:18:58.208 --> 00:19:02.833
Huh?! What are you talking
about? What are you, dense?

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:06.083
I think "dense" was a little uncalled-for.

00:19:06.083 --> 00:19:08.542
Right, sorry.

00:19:08.542 --> 00:19:10.208
Still, you don't say.

00:19:10.208 --> 00:19:13.708
Tomo, you don't think anything of Ikaros.

00:19:13.708 --> 00:19:17.167
Of course I don't think
anything of her! It could never be!

00:19:17.167 --> 00:19:19.250
You don't say.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:20.667
Good grief.

00:19:20.667 --> 00:19:22.875
Sakurai, you devil you.

00:19:22.875 --> 00:19:25.042
I'm just saying...

00:19:25.042 --> 00:19:28.208
I'm just saying, with them...

00:19:28.208 --> 00:19:30.458
I'm not sure if I'm glad to see them

00:19:31.292 --> 00:19:34.792
living peaceful lives,
like other, normal girls,

00:19:34.792 --> 00:19:39.708
or what I feel...

00:19:39.708 --> 00:19:43.583
I would like it if Ikaros became
a little more humanlike,

00:19:43.583 --> 00:19:47.875
and got so she could smile, though.

00:19:48.667 --> 00:19:54.042
"I love you," "I'm in love with
you," ...Downers are so pedestrian.

00:19:56.292 --> 00:19:59.667
You don't stand a chance of
understanding the word "love"

00:19:59.667 --> 00:20:02.667
with your eyes that green color, do you?

00:20:03.625 --> 00:20:06.292
Do you want me to show you?

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.417
This is perfect.

00:20:08.417 --> 00:20:12.083
Right now, there's no one else
here. It's just the two of us.

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:21.667
I've been by your side, watching you,
for a long time. A long time.

00:20:21.667 --> 00:20:23.500
Commence scan.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:31.208
Function block 99% enabled.
Variable wing block 72% enabled.

00:20:31.208 --> 00:20:36.542
Memory block 100%, emotional block 100%.

00:20:36.542 --> 00:20:39.958
Aha, I knew it. It's not just
your abilities and memory,

00:20:39.958 --> 00:20:44.333
they even put a block on
your emotions, too. What a joke.

00:20:44.333 --> 00:20:45.625
What...?

00:20:45.625 --> 00:20:49.417
You're almost a doll. You, who
were feared as the Uranus Queen,

00:20:49.417 --> 00:20:52.875
and rocked all of Synapse!

00:20:56.958 --> 00:20:58.750
Am I interrupting?

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:01.625
Whatever do you mean?

00:21:12.083 --> 00:21:15.167
Alpha doesn't understand love, or passion,

00:21:15.167 --> 00:21:18.667
and yet she's reading those
love letters. Isn't that ridiculous?

00:21:18.667 --> 00:21:23.625
Yeah. Apparently, her emotions are restricted.

00:21:23.625 --> 00:21:27.458
But you, who are also
an Angeloid, are different.

00:21:27.458 --> 00:21:30.167
It almost looks as though
you were sent to Earth

00:21:30.167 --> 00:21:33.000
for a different objective.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.833
What are you trying to say?

00:21:40.292 --> 00:21:43.458
<i>What is this word?</i>

00:21:43.458 --> 00:21:49.875
<i>I do not know its meaning,</i>
<i>but it bothers me for some reason. Why?</i>

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.458
I love you...

00:21:58.667 --> 00:22:04.042
What does it mean, Master?

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:26.042
<i>Don't look away, don't turn away</i>

00:22:27.083 --> 00:22:30.625
<i>You're beautiful</i>

00:22:30.625 --> 00:22:38.583
<i>Even if you lose the fight,</i>
<i>you're beautiful</i>

00:22:40.208 --> 00:22:46.250
<i>If you take up the dirt from the field now,</i>

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:52.042
<i>to leave the mark of your youth</i>

00:22:52.042 --> 00:22:58.250
<i>nobody will laugh at your tears,</i>

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:04.083
<i>nobody will withhold their applause</i>

00:23:04.083 --> 00:23:10.333
<i>Let's meet up again someday</i>

00:23:10.333 --> 00:23:16.667
<i>Let's meet up again someday</i>

00:23:16.667 --> 00:23:25.875
<i>I will never forget your face</i>

00:23:47.250 --> 00:23:51.542
Yes, I shall bring the
Uranus Queen back here.

00:23:57.125 --> 00:24:08.086
I swear I will do as you say.
Please leave her to me, Master.
